  "details": "Please Add Support for AntiLatency Body Trackers and its floor pad that goes with them.\nThis VR Tracking is the best around currently and I could have 7 Trackers if this game supported or allowed it. But at least allowing me to use 3 Trackers From AntiLatency would at least allow me to be able to play the game using a diff Body tracking that is incredibility precise.\nhttps://antilatency.com/\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5UWs7eBPHhA&t=2s\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_H4Ohsc6sq8\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1VfFXoJiGFU\nReally hoping this does not just get buried in all the other requests and gets added within the next year before I die from Covid lmao.. :/ \nI am sure they will get to it quickly I hope so I have faith in them the devs for VRChat have been hella chill so far it seems. I am new to VR CHat soo yah lol.",
